    "text": "(Section 14) In regard to the title to parcel of land No. 156 of Block 01 contained in the Cadastral Map No. 510285 situated in the village of Goda-kalana within the Grama Niladhari Division of 01 - Looluwagoda in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Meerigama in the District of Gampaha in the Province of Western published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2062/22 of 14th, March 2018. \u201cWith the right to access with servitude of parcel No 33 and with the right to draw electricity and telephone cables and lay water pipelines\u201d mentioned in the column \u201cParticulars regarding mortgages, encumbrances pending adjudication and injunction\u201d is amended as \u201cWith the right to access with servitude of parcel No 336 and with the right to draw electricity and telephone cables and lay water pipelines\u201d K.A.K. RANJITH DHARMAPALA, Commissioner of Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla 10th July, 2018 08-07",
